WEBVTT

00:00:00.340 --> 00:00:03.300
Remember when your favourite show had its
own day?

00:00:03.620 --> 00:00:07.540
That little thing to look forward to.
That’s The Daily Telly.

00:00:07.820 --> 00:00:13.140
Sesame Street on Mondays. Mister Rogers on
Tuesdays. And Wednesdays? Bluey.

00:00:13.540 --> 00:00:15.620
You choose the channels and plan the week.

00:00:15.940 --> 00:00:17.480
Your children have their own view,

00:00:17.480 --> 00:00:20.420
with just the favourites you’ve chosen for
today.

00:00:20.780 --> 00:00:25.680
A familiar routine. Clearer boundaries.
And something worth waiting for.

00:00:25.960 --> 00:00:28.300
Then, there’s a whole day beyond the
screen.

00:00:28.300 --> 00:00:32.840
Free to use. Open source. Built around
your family.

00:00:33.280 --> 00:00:36.980
Watch on Android, Google TV, iOS, or the
web.

00:00:37.300 --> 00:00:41.380
The Daily Telly. A little less scrolling.
A little more ritual.

00:00:41.920 --> 00:00:44.560
Make your week at thedailytelly.com.
